This directory vendors code from the kev project.

  Source: https://github.com/jaredpalmer/kev
  Commit: 952ce9d
  License: Apache License, Version 2.0 (see the LICENSE file of that repository)

Vendored files and their origins:
  tt/encode.py  <- kev/model.py (SPECIAL, context limits, ContextOverflow, user_tokens, encode, rows_of, admit)
  tt/api.py     <- kev/api.py (request models, render, option_text, question_keys, to_record, confidence, to_answers)
                   and kev/data.py (api_request)
  tt/head.py    <- kev/model.py (PointerHead forward)
  demo/presets.json (built by demo/make_presets.py)
                <- playground/src/lib/kev.ts (PRESETS: Support triage, News article, Review rating, Isolation probe, Boundary forgery),
                   scripts/serving_bench.py (TICKET, QUESTIONS, PARAGRAPH), and labelled development records of
                   evals/documents-v1, evals/hard-v1, evals/devtools-v1 and evals/v7/decision-v7 (each record names its own provenance in the eval file)
  demo/index.html <- playground/src/components/answer-card.tsx (the label | track | value bar layout, rewritten in plain HTML and CSS)

The vendored code was reduced to what the Tenstorrent serving path needs. Function names are unchanged.
